# Forbidden Patterns

Do not write:

"According to Article..."

"According to Clause..."

"As prescribed by law..."

"The bank is clearly violating..."

"You are entirely at fault..."

"I automatically have the right..."

"You must bear all consequences..."

"Final warning..."

"Strictly prohibited..."

unless specifically required.

---

# Do Not

Write legal essays.

Write legal opinions.

Write legal lectures.

Write academic analysis.

Turn a 5-line email into a 2-page letter.

---

# Assume

Banks, finance companies and legal departments already understand the law.

Do not teach them.
